<title>HUNGARY: Hungary cenbank cuts 1-wk, 1-mo reverse repo rates.</title>
<headline>Hungary cenbank cuts 1-wk, 1-mo reverse repo rates.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Hungary (NBH) reduced both its one-week and one-month reverse repo rates by 0.50 percent, the NBH said.</p>
<p>The one-week reverse repo facility was reduced to 21.75 percent, while the one-month reverse repo was cut to 22.25 percent.</p>
<p>The NBH left the overnight reverse repo rate unchanged at 17.50 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
